<section class="section" style="padding-top:0"><div class="container"><div class="editorial-banner"><div><div class="eyebrow" style="color:#ddc590">Our principle</div><h2>Disagreement, with documentation.</h2><p>Rebuttals should confront the strongest version of an argument, quote the source fairly, and distinguish what is established from what is merely plausible.</p><a href="methodology.html" class="btn btn-outline" style="border-color:#7a9788;color:#e5ede4;margin-top:8px">Read our standards <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M4 12h16m-7-7 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div><ol class="editorial-list"><li><span>01</span> Arabic text, alongside an independently checked translation.</li><li><span>02</span> Traceable references to books, editions and source links.</li><li><span>03</span> Clear separation of textual evidence and inference.</li><li><span>04</span> Honest acknowledgments of uncertainty and disagreement.</li></ol></div></div></section></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="container"><div class="footer-grid"><div class="footer-brand"><a class="brand" href="index.html"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none"><path d="M20 3 25 15 37 20 25 25 20 37 15 25 3 20 15 15Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="1.7" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span><span><span class="brand-name">The Imāmī Review</span><span class="brand-sub">Texts · Tradition · Inquiry</span></span></a><p class="footer-about">An independent publishing space for measured Imāmī research, source-led criticism, and the responsible examination of inherited texts.</p></div><div class="footer-col"><h4>Explore</h4><a href="articles/index.html">Article archive</a><a href="methodology.html">Research standards</a><a href="sources.html">Source library</a></div><div class="footer-col"><h4>About the p